<td>[DATA EXPUNGED]</td>
<td>Underneath a pre-installed bobblehead.</td>
<td>A small button located in the bobblehead.</td>
<td>Responsible for the destruction of testing Site 12.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Various unknown components</td>
<td>Various areas</td>
