<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-2"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-2')">2</a>. Decoy building 98-C may be used for family/friend gatherings, to maintain moral and security.</div>
<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-3"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-3')">3</a>. Testing has shown the horsepower of SCP-XXXX may very well be . SCP-XXXX is composed of an unknown metallic material capable of generating and resisting extreme temperatures, the highest recorded being 7,092ºC.[[footnote]]The default amount of heat generated has been comparable to the earth’s core.</div>
<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-4"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-4')">4</a>. It is for this reason that SCP-XXXX has a tesla coil docking station in the containment chamber.</div>
<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-5"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-5')">5</a>. It is for this reason a package of C4 is located within SCP-XXXX’s containment chamber in the form of a present.</div>
<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-6"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-6')">6</a>. See <strong>After-Incident-Report-XXXX-RC</strong> for more details.</div>
<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-7"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-7')">7</a>. This can also be caused by faulty maintenance.</div>
<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-8"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-8')">8</a>. <strong>See Addendum: XXXX-A-R/R</strong>for more details.</div>
<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-9"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-9')">9</a>. Approximately two weeks after the event, Dr. ██████ attempted to activate SCP-XXXX before [DATA EXPUNGED]. This was also the first time that SCP-XXXX seemed to respond “flawlessly” to its driver</div>
<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-10"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-10')">10</a>. ██████ was later confirmed to have been scheduled to perform with SCP-XXXX before the attack</div>
<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-11"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-11')">11</a>. accompanied by an image of what appears to show a snowflake pattern of construction tools and various weaponry, and an electrified hammer in the center.</div>
<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-12"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-12')">12</a>. see Document-XXXX-p-G.O.I-XX</div>
<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-13"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-13')">13</a>. See <strong>Document XXXX-T2-A</strong> for full information on tests conducted with trailers.</div>
<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-14"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-14')">14</a>. around the size of the fourth largest recorded domestic horse</div>
<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-15"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-15')">15</a>. It is for this reason SCP-XXXX has not been disassembled to examine.</div>
<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-16"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-16')">16</a>. It is currently unknown if the individual is the owner or an employee of the company.</div>
<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-17"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-17')">17</a>. At least 3/4ths of site-95 were completely eradicated.</div>
<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-18"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-18')">18</a>. Examination afterward showed Agent had suffered a mild concussion.</div>
<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-19"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-19')">19</a>. the placing of the sticker suggests it was added hastily.</div>
